# Paragraph on DemoPage

## Source of truth
- Every demo is a **copy-paste from a real project usage**.
- **Text**: same `t('…')` keys or hardcoded strings the page uses. No invented `demo.paragraph.*` samples.
- One `ShowCodeToggle` per **visually distinct** style.

## Distinct only
- Keep **one sample per look**: different color, weight, size, or theme.
- Do **not** stack near-duplicates (multiple white home bodies, multiple `#344054` helpers, FAQ vs service panel same gray, etc.).

## Colors & chrome
- Exact project colors (including `text-white`). No `!text-black`, no demo background boxes.

## Do not demo
- PaymentFailed reason, PublishDatePicker schedule warnings, HomeFooter email, ThumbnailUploader `Selected: {name}`.
- Fake `leftIcon` / Heroicons samples. No real page passes `leftIcon` to `Paragraph` or `Heading`.
- Left/right span **are** real `Paragraph`s inside `DashboardTextInput`. Show that exact paragraph markup with the real span text and classes: AddTier `USD$` semibold, payout `USD$` font-normal `#344054`, AddTier `% off` `text-medium-text`. Do not wrap an input in an external `<span>`.
